                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]An Adventure RPG[/h1]\nhttps://youtu.be/8Q0ND44XBls\n+ Visually the game has a unique visual style with 3D environments mixed with 2D characters or sprites.\n+  The gameplay is decent with a Action Turn Based combat system which relies on you making quick decisions and pressing arrow keys to dodge or \"deflect\" enemy attacks.\n+ An interesting fantasy setting with some humorous characters and dialogue that can be quite funny.\n\n- default controls are a bit odd. You use the mouse, the arrow keys, and the [A] and [D] keys. I don't have 3 arms, so it felt a bit weird switching between them. You can rebind the keys though, so it's not a big problem.\n- I had problems when facing the second boss who seemed a bit overpowered. Not sure if I needed to go back and grind for levels or what the problem was.",
